Package: MRSuSiE
Type: Package
Title: Joint Prioritization of Exposures and Direct Variant Effects
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "sche11@lsuhsc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the common MR-SuSiE method for one or more exposures
    using harmonized genome-wide association summary statistics and signed
    linkage disequilibrium. Joint role localization is followed by corrected-score
    estimation and covariance-aware empirical-Bayes point estimation. Separate
    score-centered intervals, tests and selection diagnostics are returned.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, susieR (== 0.14.2), MASS, jsonlite, digest, stats, utils
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/chen-siyi7/MR-SuSiE
BugReports: https://github.com/chen-siyi7/MR-SuSiE/issues
SystemRequirements: C++17, BLAS, LAPACK
NeedsCompilation: yes
